    "directions": [
      "In a bowl mix gram flour, degi red chilli powder, turmeric powder, salt, water, oil and mix everything properly and make a thick runny batter. Keep aside for at least 30 minutes.",
      "After that pour this batter in a medium sized pan and place it on low heat.",
      "Cook from both sides until light golden. Remove and keep aside to cool down.",
      "Once cooled cut it in the strips like french fries.",
      "Then deep fry in medium hot oil until golden brown and crispy.",
      "Remove and serve with tempered ketchup and garnish with tomato wedges and coriander leaves.",
      "In a pan heat oil and add mustard seeds, ginger, curry leaves, green chillies saute for a minute.",
      "Switch off the flames and add little water mix properly then add tomato ketchup and bring everything together. Keep aside for further use."
    ],
